# Copy to `.env` (chmod 600). NEVER commit .env (it is in .gitignore).
#
# HL_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS — your main HL account address (0x...).
#   Needed for `capital.mode: auto`, which sizes the book from the wallet's equity. That query is READ-ONLY
#   and needs NO private key, so set this ALONE and paper mode will already size itself to the real wallet.
#   Without it (or if the query fails) the book falls back to `capital.paper_equity_usd`.
#
# HL_PRIVATE_KEY — ONLY needed for mode: live.
#   Use an HL API/AGENT wallet (create in the HL UI: "API" -> generate agent wallet), NOT your main MetaMask
#   key. The agent wallet can trade your account but cannot withdraw — the correct key to put on a server.
HL_ACCOUNT_ADDRESS=
HL_PRIVATE_KEY=
